{"questions":[{"id":"Q071","typeId":"天平消去","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S04:p1","S07:p2"],"prompt":"每個圓柱與每個方塊分別同重。已知2圓柱+3方塊＝18克，2圓柱+1方塊＝10克，求一個方塊重幾克？","answer":"4","explanation":"兩式相減得2方塊＝8克。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"8/3","misconception":"相減後誤用原來3方塊當成差額，錯除以3。"},{"id":"c2","text":"2","misconception":"相減後將方塊數3與1相加成4，誤以8除以4。"},{"id":"c3","text":"4"},{"id":"c4","text":"8","misconception":"兩式相減得2方塊重8克，卻未再除以2。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q073","typeId":"數字金字塔","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S13:p1"],"prompt":"三層數字塔的底列為3x、x、5，上層每格等於正下方兩格的和。塔頂為65，求x。","answer":"12","explanation":"中層4x及x+5，頂層5x+5＝65，x＝12。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"12"},{"id":"c2","text":"13","misconception":"得5x+5＝65後漏掉常數5，直接以65除5。"},{"id":"c3","text":"15","misconception":"塔頂誤認為底層三格直接相加，漏掉中間格x被加兩次。"},{"id":"c4","text":"60","misconception":"移項得到5x＝60後，忘記再除以5。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q076","typeId":"直尺比例平移","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S14:p3"],"prompt":"兩尺零刻度對齊時，甲尺24對齊乙尺36。將甲尺零刻度移到乙尺5，則甲尺18對齊乙尺多少？","answer":"32","explanation":"刻度比乙/甲＝3/2；18×3/2+5＝32。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"17","misconception":"顛倒兩尺比例，用18×2/3再加5。"},{"id":"c2","text":"69/2","misconception":"先將18與平移量5相加再乘3/2，混淆兩尺單位。"},{"id":"c3","text":"27","misconception":"只做18×3/2的比例換算，漏掉零刻度平移5。"},{"id":"c4","text":"32"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q079","typeId":"兩數比例差","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S02:p4","S10:p1","S13:p2","S14:p5"],"prompt":"兩個數相差54，小數是大數的2/5。求大數。","answer":"90","explanation":"x−2x/5＝54，得x＝90。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"x-2*x/5=54","root":"90","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"36","misconception":"求得小數卻當成大數；大數90的2/5才是36。"},{"id":"c2","text":"270","misconception":"把相差54誤當成大數的1/5；應以1−2/5列式。"},{"id":"c3","text":"90"},{"id":"c4","text":"135","misconception":"誤把兩數差54當成大數的2/5；實際差占大數3/5。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q080","typeId":"三人金額","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S02:p3","S02:p5","S10:p1","S14:p5"],"prompt":"宇澄的點數是沛寧的4倍，沛寧比可昕少35點，可昕比宇澄少175點。三人共有多少點？","answer":"455","explanation":"設沛寧x，x+35＝4x−175，x＝70；合計280+70+105。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"x+35=4*x-175","root":"70","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"175","misconception":"只加沛寧70與可昕105，漏算宇澄的280點。"},{"id":"c2","text":"420","misconception":"只用6倍沛寧點數，漏掉可昕比沛寧多的35點。"},{"id":"c3","text":"70","misconception":"只求得沛寧點數；三人總點數還要加宇澄與可昕。"},{"id":"c4","text":"455"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q081","typeId":"代數平均","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S02:p1","S02:p2","S02:p3","S04:p2"],"prompt":"若予安五次測驗有三次皆為x分、兩次皆為85分，平均91分。求x。","answer":"95","explanation":"3x+170＝455，得x＝95。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"3*x+170=5*91","root":"95","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"95"},{"id":"c2","text":"100","misconception":"把三次x與兩次85的人次對調；應列3x+170＝455。"},{"id":"c3","text":"97","misconception":"把兩組平均分數等權相加，誤列(x+85)÷2＝91；兩組其實各有三次與兩次測驗。"},{"id":"c4","text":"87","misconception":"每次x應補(91−85)×2÷3＝4分，卻用91減4；x應高於91才能補足85。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q083","typeId":"兩科成績列式","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S04:p2"],"prompt":"采薇兩科合計158分，數學比英文的2倍少58分。求數學分數。","answer":"86","explanation":"設數學x，x＝2(158−x)−58，解得86。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"x=2*(158-x)-58","root":"86","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"316/3","misconception":"把少58漏掉，誤設數學為英文兩倍；須保留減58。"},{"id":"c2","text":"374/3","misconception":"把數學比英文兩倍少58改成多58；應保留減58的方向。"},{"id":"c3","text":"86"},{"id":"c4","text":"72","misconception":"這是英文分數；題目要求數學，應用158減去英文。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q084","typeId":"連續整數","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S11:p2","S12:p4","S18:p1"],"prompt":"五個連續整數相加為145，最大整數是多少？","answer":"31","explanation":"設最小x，5x+10＝145，x＝27，最大31。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"5*x+10=145","root":"27","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"29","misconception":"145除以5得到中間整數；最大數還須比中間數多2。"},{"id":"c2","text":"27","misconception":"這是五數中最小整數；題目要最大數，須再加4。"},{"id":"c3","text":"33","misconception":"把五個連續整數當成連續奇數，錯用間隔2。"},{"id":"c4","text":"31"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q085","typeId":"連續奇數","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S02:p1","S02:p4","S13:p1"],"prompt":"七個連續奇數相加為273，最小奇數是多少？","answer":"33","explanation":"設最小x，7x+42＝273，得x＝33。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"7*x+42=273","root":"33","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"33"},{"id":"c2","text":"45","misconception":"選到了七個連續奇數中的最大數；題目要求最小數。"},{"id":"c3","text":"39","misconception":"273除以7得到中央奇數；最小奇數應比中央少6。"},{"id":"c4","text":"36","misconception":"誤把連續奇數當成連續整數；相鄰奇數必須差2。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q087","typeId":"數字易位","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S02:p3","S02:p5","S11:p1","S12:p2","S13:p1"],"prompt":"一個二位數的兩位數字和為12，交換兩位後，新數比原數大36。求原數。","answer":"48","explanation":"設十位x，原數9x+12，新數120−9x，差36，得x＝4。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"(120-9*x)-(9*x+12)=36","root":"4","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"84","misconception":"這是交換數字後的新數；題目要求交換前的原數。"},{"id":"c2","text":"66","misconception":"只滿足數字和12，交換後數值不變，未滿足增加36。"},{"id":"c3","text":"48"},{"id":"c4","text":"39","misconception":"只湊出數字和12，未檢查交換後增加的是54而非36。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q089","typeId":"分組盈虧","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S02:p3","S09:p1","S10:p1","S11:p2","S16:p1"],"prompt":"星河營分隊數固定，每隊24人會多18人，每隊27人則少9人。共有幾隊？","answer":"9","explanation":"24x+18＝27x−9，x＝9。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"24*x+18=27*x-9","root":"9","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"9"},{"id":"c2","text":"27","misconception":"算出盈虧總差卻未除以每隊多容納的3人。"},{"id":"c3","text":"6","misconception":"只用多出的18人除以3；還須計入第二方案少9人。"},{"id":"c4","text":"3","misconception":"把盈餘18與不足9相減；總人數落差應為18+9。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q090","typeId":"分物盈虧","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S10:p1","S11:p1","S13:p2"],"prompt":"若每位學員發8枚徽章，會剩下27枚；每人發11枚則不足36枚。共有幾位學員？","answer":"21","explanation":"8x+27＝11x−36，得x＝21。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"8*x+27=11*x-36","root":"21","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"12","misconception":"只用不足36除以3，漏算原本剩下的27枚徽章。"},{"id":"c2","text":"21"},{"id":"c3","text":"3","misconception":"把剩27與不足36相減後除以3；兩種分配間的總差應用27+36。"},{"id":"c4","text":"63","misconception":"只算兩方案總差63枚；還須除以每人多發的3枚。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"}]}